WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
Time a lane change to earn the cyan Perfect response.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:08.000
Five consecutive Perfect actions unlock the gold response and 2x multiplier.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Jump and switch lanes through the generated rhythm pattern.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Later in the same run: lane changes and jumps through the normal-phase patterns.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Later in the same run: denser rows combine lane blocks and jump obstacles.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:56.900
Clear the final obstacles and reach the end of the track.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:01.900
Level finished: 29,765 points, 119 Perfects, no hits and three lives remaining.
